g, not the default.** `code:lint` and `code:format` check by\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/ruff/conventions.md:24:`code:format`**, before `uv run ruff format`. dprint owns every file type it\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/swift-format/conventions.md:28:`code:format` checks, and with `--fix` rewrites, through this configuration.\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/swift-format/skills/swift-format/SKILL.md:29:mise run code:format          # check — exits non-zero on any unformatted file\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/swift-format/skills/swift-format/SKILL.md:30:mise run code:format --fix    # rewrite in place\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/swift-format/skills/swift-format/SKILL.md:72:  `mise run code:format --fix` over the whole tree, commit both together with\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/eslint/conventions.md:26:calls `mise run code:lint --fix` with the staged files. The task\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/eslint/conventions.md:35:`code:lint` runs the linter reads it, not this one alone. It lands **empty of\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/eslint/skills/eslint/SKILL.md:61:mise run code:format          # dprint check (verify) + sort-package-json --check\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/eslint/skills/eslint/SKILL.md:62:mise run code:format --fix    # dprint fmt (apply) + sort-package-json (dev)\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/eslint/skills/eslint/SKILL.md:63:mise run code:lint            # linter (mise-pinned), whole tree\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/eslint/skills/eslint/SKILL.md:64:mise run code:lint --fix      # apply the linter's auto-fixes\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/eslint/skills/eslint/SKILL.md:65:mise run code:lint src/a.ts   # narrows the shell/workflow gates only\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/eslint/skills/eslint/SKILL.md:116:- **Format check fails** → run `dprint fmt` (or `mise run code:format --fix`).\nplugins/stackgen/stacks/toolchain-gate/esl