                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \n| E19 | Checker in two steps      | U1 widens (wave 1): accept a pack `templates/` folder, subtask paths, a pack with no `tool-config:`; add E18. U5 tightens (wave 3): refuse `tool-config:` and `machine_env` keys, validate that a pack's `templates/` uses only `@@` names from the Template names table or its own `packs.<slug>` keys, drop the `schema.mjs` import and delete it, rewrite rule 15's readers for the new asset paths. Commit order in wave 3: U4 then U5.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     \n| E20 | Inventory mid-run         | U3 runs `mise run p:plugins:inventory` and commits `inventory.md` with its pack edits — the one exception to \"units never run generators\"; U8 regenerates it after the bumps.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          